<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Out of Time - KAYTRANADA Remix</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">The Weeknd, KAYTRANADA</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Out Of Time (Remix Bundle)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4Rrj1QxDqsj28gv9SiHQRA</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.870" end="00:05.330">Yeah-yeah, yeah-yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.330" end="00:09.620">Yeah-yeah, ye-yeah, yeah-yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.620" end="00:14.140">Yeah-yeah, yeah-yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.140" end="00:18.560">Yeah-yeah, ye-yeah, yeah-yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.560" end="00:23.070">Yeah-yeah, yeah-yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.070" end="00:27.590">Yeah-yeah, ye-yeah, yeah-yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.590" end="00:32.090">Yeah-yeah, yeah-yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.090" end="00:36.230">Yeah-yeah, ye-yeah, yeah-yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.230" end="00:40.730">The last few months, I've been workin' on me, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.730" end="00:45.080">There's so much trauma in my life (girl)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.080" end="00:49.590">I've been so cold to the ones who loved me, baby, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.590" end="00:53.010">I look back now and I realize</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.010" end="00:58.610">And I remember when I held you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.610" end="01:02.960">You begged me with your drowning eyes to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.960" end="01:06.430">And I regret I didn't tell you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.430" end="01:08.560">Now I can't keep you from loving him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.560" end="01:10.730">You made up your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.730" end="01:15.260">Say I love you, girl, but I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.260" end="01:19.750">Say I'm there for you, but I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.750" end="01:23.980">Say that I'll care for you, but I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.980" end="01:28.830">Said I'm too late to make you mine, out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.830" end="01:36.830" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.970" end="01:53.360">Out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.360" end="01:57.880">Out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.880" end="02:04.370">Out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.370" end="02:06.720">If he mess up just a little</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.720" end="02:08.810">Baby, you know my line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.810" end="02:10.950">If you don't trust him a little</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.950" end="02:13.340">Then come right back, girl, come right back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.340" end="02:15.480">Give me one chance, just a little</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.480" end="02:17.660">Baby, I'll treat you right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.660" end="02:21.890">And I'll love you like I shoulda loved you all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.890" end="02:27.620">And I remember when I held you (held you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.620" end="02:31.990">You begged me with your drowning eyes to stay (never again, baby)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.990" end="02:35.140">And I regret I didn't tell you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.140" end="02:37.590">Now I can't keep you from loving him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.590" end="02:39.750">You made up your mind (uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.750" end="02:44.230">Say I love you, girl, but I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.230" end="02:48.470">Say I'm there for you, but I'm out of time (ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.470" end="02:52.970">Say that I'll care for you, but I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.970" end="02:57.550">Said I'm too late to make you mine, out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.550" end="03:01.860">Ooh-ooh-ooh, singin' (out of time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.860" end="03:06.360">Said I had you to myself, but I'm (out of time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.360" end="03:10.860">Say that I'll care for you, but I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.860" end="03:15.720">But I'm too late to make you mine, out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.720" end="03:23.720" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.460" end="03:39.930">Out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:39.930" end="03:44.500">Out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:44.500" end="03:46.460">Out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:46.460" end="03:53.330" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:53.330" end="03:57.860">Out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:57.860" end="04:02.040">Out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:02.040" end="04:04.450">Out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:04.450" end="04:12.450" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:17.080" end="04:21.840">Hey, hey, hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:21.840" end="04:25.840" /></div></body></tt>